      "help_zh": "授予该应用的权限范围信息，可填写多个范围，以分号（；）分隔。\n\n\n支持的权限范围可以参考https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/93693.html中的“OAuth范围”",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "scopes",
      "options": [
        "--scopes"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Scopes",
